                  {
                      "description":  "After Node is installed via nvm: run \u0027corepack enable\u0027 once so pnpm/yarn resolve on PATH via Node\u0027s corepack shims. Repos with a packageManager pin (e.g. UrAtlas pins pnpm@9.15.0) auto-download the right version on first use. Verify: pnpm --version",
